        {
          "es": "La última vez, Quetzalcóatl trajo los huesos del Mictlan, y los dioses hicieron gente nueva.",
          "en": "Last time, Quetzalcoatl brought the bones up from Mictlan, and the gods made new people."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero los dioses se preguntaron: \"¿Y qué van a comer?\"",
          "en": "But the gods asked each other: \"And what will they eat?\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que empezaron a buscar alimento.",
          "en": "So they began to search for food."
        }
