      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Se llevaron el maíz blanco, el negro, el amarillo y el rojo. Y también frijol, amaranto y chía.",
          "en": "They took the white maize, the black, the yellow and the red. And beans, amaranth and chia too."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso el maíz no es solo amarillo: en México hay maíz blanco, azul, negro y rojo.",
          "en": "That is why maize is not only yellow: in Mexico there is white, blue, black and red maize."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde entonces, los tlaloques guardan esas semillas y las devuelven con la lluvia.",
          "en": "Since then, the tlaloque keep those seeds, and give them back with the rain."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso, decían, cuando no llueve no hay cosecha.",
          "en": "That is why, they said, when there is no rain, there is no harvest."
        }
      ],
