          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ya había gente, y había maíz. Pero el mundo seguía a oscuras: no había sol.",
          "en": "Now there were people, and there was maize. But the world was still dark: there was no sun."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se reunieron en un lugar llamado Teotihuacan.",
          "en": "The gods gathered at a place called Teotihuacan."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Quién crees que será tan valiente como para convertirse en el sol? Cuéntanos en los comentarios.",
          "en": "Who do you think will be brave enough to become the sun? Tell us in the comments."
